{"id":"crise","lemma":"crise","pos":"noun","rank":992,"glosses":["crisis","attack, fit","tantrum, scene, fit of anger"],"ipa":"/kʁiz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fc/Fr-crise.ogg/Fr-crise.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"crises"},"formAudio":{"crises":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-crises.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous sommes en pleine crise.","en":"We're in the middle of a crisis.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"full, full up","l":"plein"},null]},{"text":"Il est sujet à des crises de colère.","en":"He is subject to fits of anger.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"subject, topic"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"anger, rage"}]},{"text":"J'ai eu une crise cardiaque.","en":"I had a heart attack.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/12296","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"cardiac"}]},{"text":"Comment pouvons-nous surmonter cette crise ?","en":"How can we get past this crisis?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to overcome"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes au cœur d'une crise.","en":"We're in the middle of a crisis.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}